      "why_it_matters": "The public breach between Defence Minister Robles and Interior Minister Marlaska over whether the CNI warned of the Ceuta crisis exposes a fractured government response to border security and undermines public confidence in whether Spain's intelligence and security apparatus are functioning as a coordinated unit during emergencies."
